"answer": "Email 1: Emily Watson, CMO of Urban Renewal Properties, requests a proposal from Casey for a video marketing series to showcase innovative property development projects. The goal is to attract investors and buyers with content highlighting sustainability and modern design, with a target launch by the end of next quarter.\n\nEmail 2: Alex invites everyone to a charity fundraiser for the local animal shelter on Saturday, December 10th, from 2:00 PM to 5:00 PM at the Community Center. The event features games, raffles, and a bake sale, with all proceeds going to the shelter. RSVPs are requested by December 1st. Additionally, Alex mentions a friend arriving on Friday, December 9th, and asks if anyone can help pick her up from the station."
